## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Speed Leveling
## Notes: One key for questing, pressed again and again: it opens the loot of the corpse beside you, picks up what your quests want beside you, finds what your quests and your leveling guide want around you, puts a skull on it, and attacks it or talks to it; it hearths when your guide says so, and uses a quest item when nothing is around. Shows your leveling guide's steps over the world. Give it a key in the game's key bindings, under Sane UI.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_MarkedForDeath
